plugin-db-qualification (2026112401) unstable; urgency=medium

  * plugin-qualification-db-write reads the hosting words from the contract
    package omx-clap, <contractdir>/3/omx-clap/, where omx-clap 0.34.0
    installs them; it refused every put on an install of that release with
    contract.domain.absent, so plugin-qualify-sync stored nothing (#78).
    The name before 0.34.0, omx-clap-core, is not read.
  * The records package builds against omx-clap-contract 0.34.0 or later,
    and reads qualification and machine from plugin-hostd-contract 0.21.0
    or later and probe from plugin-hostd-protocol-contract 0.8.0 or later;
    plugin-qualify-contract, which conflicts with plugin-hostd-contract
    0.21.1, is no build dependency.
  * The fedora44 measuring Job's provenance names omx-clap-libs and
    omx-clap-contract.
  * The writer's and the base build's tests read each domain from its owner
    (plugin-hostd, plugin-hostd-protocol) through one fixture module.

